  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/active-voice> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/active-voice/s4> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/active-voice> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/active-voice/s5> .
