  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/active-voice> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#challengedBy> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/fear-and-loathing-of-the-english-passive> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/active-voice> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#contrastsWith> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/passive-voice> .
